\"420\" height=\"247\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>The tattered remains of clothing.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>All new non-<a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a> characters begin with this armor equipped.</li>\n<li>Starter Rags can be combined with a <a href=\"/page/Dust_of_Disjunction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dust of Disjunction\">Dust of Disjunction</a> at an <a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Item Deconstruction station</a> to form craftable bound to character <a href=\"/page/Item:Rags\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Rags\">Item:Rags</a> with the same Durability and Hardness of Starter Rags.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230536\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3894/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22202/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6272/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 34/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion d